---
Package standalone distribution.

Create a packaging script that bundles the standalone executable with
required assets (samples, presets) into a distributable archive.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Script produces a self-contained directory or archive
- [ ] Includes sequencer_standalone executable
- [ ] Includes bundled 808 samples
- [ ] Includes any required shared libraries (or statically linked)
- [ ] README with basic usage instructions included
- [ ] Works on Linux (tar.gz), Windows (zip) outputs

## Test Plan
- [ ] Run packaging script, verify archive created
- [ ] Extract archive on clean system, verify executable runs
- [ ] Verify samples load from bundled paths
